- # cc-soul — Your AI, But It Actually Knows You
- cc-soul is a local API that gives any AI persistent memory, adaptive personality, and emotional awareness. Install once, runs at `localhost:18800`.
- ## Install
- ```bash
- openclaw plugins install @cc-soul/openclaw
- ```
- ```
- ```
- ## How It Works
- Your AI sends messages to cc-soul, gets back enriched context (memories, persona, emotion), and feeds that to the LLM. After the LLM replies, send the reply back so cc-soul can learn.
- POST /process  { message, user_id }  → memories + persona + augments
- POST /feedback { user_message, reply } → cc-soul learns
- ## API Endpoints
- | Method | Path | What it does |
- |--------|------|-------------|
- | `POST` | `/process` | Send message, get augmented context |
- | `POST` | `/feedback` | Send AI reply, cc-soul learns |
- | `POST` | `/soul` | cc-soul replies directly (needs LLM) |
- | `POST` | `/config` | Configure LLM backend |
- | `POST` | `/command` | Execute commands (stats, search, etc.) |
- | `GET` | `/profile` | User personality profile |
- | `GET` | `/features` | List feature toggles |
- | `POST` | `/features` | Enable/disable features |
- | `GET` | `/health` | Health check |
- | `GET` | `/avatar` | Soul injection prompt |
- | `GET` | `/soul-spec` | Soul spec files |
- | `GET` | `/.well-known/agent.json` | A2A Agent Card |
- | `GET` | `/mcp/tools` | MCP tool list |
- | `POST` | `/mcp/call` | Execute MCP tool |
- ## Features
- - **Persistent Memory** — remembers across sessions, detects contradictions
- - **11 Personas** — auto-switches by context
- - **Emotional Awareness** — 5D emotion model, adapts response style
- - **Correction Learning** — extracts rules, verifies before accepting
- - **Socratic Mode** — say "帮我理解", only asks questions
- - **Knowledge Graph** — entity relationship visualization
- - **Deep Understanding** — 7-dimension user model (temporal patterns, growth trajectory, cognitive load, stress fingerprint, etc.)
- | Command | What it does |
